"body":"# About\r\nCTRTool is a general purpose reading/extraction tool for Nintendo 3DS file formats.\r\n\r\n## Supported File Formats\r\n* ExeFs (.exefs)\r\n* RomFs (.romfs) (and RomFS wrapped in IVFC)\r\n* NCCH Format Variants:\r\n  * CTR Executable Image (.cxi)\r\n  * CTR File Archive (.cfa)\r\n  * CTR Initial Process (.cip)\r\n* NCCH ExtendedHeader (.exhdr)\r\n* CTR Importable Archive (.cia)\r\n* NCSD Format Variants:\r\n  * CTR Card Image (.cci/.3ds/.3dz)\r\n  * CTR System Update (.csu)\r\n* ES TitleMetaData (.tmd)\r\n* ES eTicket (.tik)\r\n* Firmware Images (.firm)\r\n* CRR (.crr)\r\n\r\n# Change Log since v1.0.4\r\n* [NEW] Add CLI option `-q`/`--quiet` which enables `silent mode` ( #113 ) \r\n* [Change] When displaying ExHeader fields, `Access info` was renamed to `FS access`\r\n* [Change] CTRTool now distingushes between three types of output\r\n  * General output (information about a file)\r\n    * These are printed to `stdout`.\r\n    * These are the only output silenced in `silent mode`. \r\n  * Warnings & Progress Indicators\r\n    * These are printed to `stderr`.\r\n    * This information is only shown in `verbose mode`. \r\n    * These are prefixed in output with a tag `[ctrtool::ClassNameHere LOG] ...`\r\n    * Progress indicators include output like `Extracting X to Y...`\r\n  * Errors\r\n    * These are printed to `stderr`.\r\n    * These will always be shown.\r\n    * These are prefixed in output with a tag `[ctrtool::ClassNameHere ERROR] ...`\r\n    * Note verification errors are only shown in `verify mode`. \r\n      * Errors with IVFC blocks will invalidate the whole IVFC layer, which is displayed as one error. To display where each block is invalid use `verbose output` mode.\r\n      * Errors with ExtendedHeader `FsAccess` bits invalidate the whole bit-field, which is displayed as one error. To display where each bit is invalid use `verbose output` mode.\r\n      * Errors with ExtendedHeader `ServiceAccess` entries invalidate the whole set, which is displayed as one error. To display where each entry is invalid use `verbose output` mode.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/64506644/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/64095452","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/64095452/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/64095452/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/tag/ctrtool-v1.0.4","id":64095452,"author":{"login":"jakcron","id":9269962,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNjk5NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9269962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron","html_url":"https://github.com/jakcron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakcron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOAZSHW84D0gTc","tag_name":"ctrtool-v1.0.4","target_commitish":"master","name":"CTRTool v1.0.4","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-11T19:31:58Z","updated_at":"2022-04-15T01:17:19Z","published_at":"2022-04-11T19:33:20Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3DSGuy/Project_CTR/releases/assets/62209034","id":62209034,"node_id":"RA_kwDOAZSHW84DtTwK","nam